# <%= current_page.data.title %>

This page is a placeholder for a walkthrough of validating your first deployment before moving on to [Path to Live](/cloud-native-platform/path-to-live/). Detailed content is tracked as a follow-up piece of work.

In the meantime, once your pull request has built successfully in Jenkins:

1. Check the deployment landed in the `preview` or `aat` environment you expect, using the `values.preview.template.yaml` / `values.aat.template.yaml` overrides described in [Helm chart](helm-chart.html#what-are-values-template-yaml-for).
2. Confirm your application responds on its ingress host and that [health probes](/cloud-native-platform/path-to-live/health-endpoints.html) are passing.
3. Confirm any infrastructure, secrets, TLS, DNS and Front Door configuration from the earlier steps has been applied without errors in the pipeline.

If something does not come up as expected, see [Troubleshooting](/cloud-native-platform/troubleshooting/) or ask in [#platops-help](https://hmcts-reform.slack.com/app_redirect?channel=platops-help).
